WEBVTT

00:06:58.763 --> 00:07:02.797
is a bit of post-traumatic growth
and not shutting down.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:04.097
And we need support.

00:07:04.097 --> 00:07:09.030
You know, it's interesting,
if something's going on with our car,

00:07:09.063 --> 00:07:10.230
we get support.

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:12.330
If something's going on
with our apartment,

00:07:12.363 --> 00:07:13.563
we get support.

00:07:13.563 --> 00:07:17.630
Sometimes we think we just have to fight
our way through grief

00:07:17.663 --> 00:07:21.430
and it's OK to ask
for support and for help.

00:07:21.463 --> 00:07:23.830
CSB: It's so important to remember that.

00:07:23.863 --> 00:07:27.963
When it's not tangible
we forget how to ask for help.

00:07:28.497 --> 00:07:29.663
Along those lines,

00:07:29.697 --> 00:07:32.463
do you believe there's
a time line for grief?